  "notes": "Form 1040 line 36: 'Amount of line 34 you want applied to your 2026 estimated tax' (f1040-2025 l.138; i1040gi-2025 l.4401: this election can't be changed later). Required only when line 34 is more than $0 (conditional_dependency_set, ADR-0037), matching rule.schedule1a-part-v-line-36a's own pattern -- a return with no overpayment is never asked and publishes $0. An answer above line 34 blocks DEPENDENCY_INVALID (the only block code the record schema keeps for an unlisted custom code -- see RECORD_CODES in packages/derivation/runner.py; not an engine change) rather than being silently reduced."
